WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.233 --> 00:00:08.600
The Ragnarok between gods and humans is fierce!

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.733
What is the anime RECORD OF RAGNAROK like?

00:00:11.733 --> 00:00:15.666
I'll tell you about its world and characters.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.633
Let's fight, one-on-one!

00:00:18.633 --> 00:00:20.466
Ta-da!

00:00:20.466 --> 00:00:22.133
Hi, it's N-ko!

00:00:22.133 --> 00:00:25.000
I love humans!

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.466
RECORD OF RAGNAROK is so exciting!

00:00:28.466 --> 00:00:32.900
I started reading the manga lately, and I'm so into it now.

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:38.300
The Ragnarok between gods and humans is fierce!

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:40.966
Putting the existence of mankind at stake,

00:00:40.966 --> 00:00:46.166
the world's representatives of gods fight against humans

00:00:46.166 --> 00:00:49.366
in 13 one-on-one matches.

00:00:49.366 --> 00:00:53.433
Just listening to the background story is enough to make me excited!

00:00:53.433 --> 00:00:59.866
This time, to tell you what the series RECORD OF RAGNAROK is like,

00:00:59.866 --> 00:01:04.300
I'll give you an introduction to its world and characters.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:11.200
Also, I'd like to talk about what I would do if I were to fight in a match.

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:12.433
Well then,

00:01:12.433 --> 00:01:15.066
let's fight, one-on-one!

00:01:15.066 --> 00:01:20.566
First, I'll tell you the abstract of RECORD OF RAGNAROK.

00:01:20.566 --> 00:01:26.066
All the gods of the whole world gather once every 1,000 years

00:01:26.066 --> 00:01:28.300
to attend a conference in heaven

00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:30.533
and decide whether humans should exist or not.

00:01:30.533 --> 00:01:34.400
Because of the foolish actions of humans,

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:37.800
all members agree to put an end to humanity.

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:39.933
But right before that,

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:43.533
one from a group of demigoddesses called Valkyries,

00:01:43.533 --> 00:01:46.766
Brünnhilde, raises an objection.

00:01:46.766 --> 00:01:50.333
"Just wiping humans out is too dull.

00:01:50.333 --> 00:01:53.666
Why don't we test the humans?"

00:01:53.666 --> 00:01:56.533
What she proposed was

00:01:56.533 --> 00:01:59.900
a final battle between gods and humans,

00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:02.600
commonly called Ragnarok.

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:07.600
From the gods of the whole world and all humans in history,

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:09.633
representatives are chosen

00:02:09.633 --> 00:02:13.233
to fight against each other one-on-one.

00:02:13.233 --> 00:02:16.000
In a total of 13 matches,

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:19.900
the side that wins seven times first would be the champion.

00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:25.433
However, it is absolutely impossible for humans to defeat gods.

00:02:25.433 --> 00:02:29.000
Since the gods mocked humans that way,

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:32.800
Brünnhilde provoked them again.

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:37.733
"What? Are you scared?"

00:02:37.733 --> 00:02:40.966
What she said infuriated the gods,

00:02:40.966 --> 00:02:46.233
so they act out of anger and agree to have the Ragnarok.

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:52.133
Thus, from the seven million years of human history,

00:02:52.133 --> 00:02:54.966
Brünnhilde chooses the strongest 13 humans

00:02:54.966 --> 00:02:57.566
to get them to fight in Ragnarok.

00:02:58.100 --> 00:03:04.266
Can humans outdo the gods and stop the extinction of humanity in the end?

00:03:04.833 --> 00:03:10.233
A tremendous, crazy, serious battle begins!

00:03:10.233 --> 00:03:11.466
Like this,

00:03:11.466 --> 00:03:14.533
the gods who try to wipe out humanity

00:03:14.533 --> 00:03:20.200
fight against human representatives one-on-one in this battle anime.

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:27.033
Now, I'll briefly introduce the characters in the anime!

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:29.266
First, it's this character.

00:03:29.866 --> 00:03:31.333
Brünnhilde,

00:03:31.333 --> 00:03:35.166
the eldest of the 13 Valkyrie sisters.

00:03:35.166 --> 00:03:37.500
She is a demigoddess,

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:40.500
and she has a deep relationship with humans.

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:42.733
So she wants to avoid the extinction of humanity

00:03:42.733 --> 00:03:47.366
and proposes the god-versus-human Ragnarok.

00:03:47.366 --> 00:03:50.366
She isn't afraid to make an objection to the gods,

00:03:50.366 --> 00:03:53.433
and she is a wise and brave lady.

00:03:53.433 --> 00:03:56.033
But she sometimes has a sharp tongue.

00:03:56.033 --> 00:04:00.733
She is the very person who proposes the fight between gods and humans.

00:04:00.733 --> 00:04:03.466
She is a very cool lady.

00:04:03.466 --> 00:04:07.466
But she actually makes very funny faces…

00:04:07.466 --> 00:04:09.066
Next, it's this character.

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:10.533
Göll,

00:04:10.533 --> 00:04:14.300
the youngest of the 13 Valkyrie sisters.

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:18.700
She loves Brünnhilde and calls her Hilde-neesama,

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:22.400
but nobody knows what she truly thinks.

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:24.333
She is cute.

00:04:24.333 --> 00:04:27.700
I want her to call me "N-ko-neesama" too.

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:31.433
Next, I'll introduce the characters who fight

00:04:31.433 --> 00:04:35.200
in the first round of the one-on-one battle of gods versus humans.

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:37.400
I'll start from the side of humans.

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:39.033
Lü Bu,

00:04:39.033 --> 00:04:43.666
the human fighter in the first round of Ragnarok.

00:04:43.666 --> 00:04:46.200
He is the strongest Chinese martial artist,

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:50.133
and Brünnhilde also praises him

00:04:50.133 --> 00:04:54.666
as the most violent and craziest warrior she'd ever met on the battlefield.

00:04:54.666 --> 00:04:57.600
Lü Bu is the extremely strong man

00:04:57.600 --> 00:05:00.000
even in the Records of the Three Kingdoms, right?

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:04.466
There's someone remarkable fighting in the first round already.

00:05:04.466 --> 00:05:09.333
The representative of gods who fights against Lü Bu is him,

00:05:09.333 --> 00:05:10.366
Thor,

00:05:10.366 --> 00:05:14.833
the god fighter in the first round of Ragnarok.

00:05:14.833 --> 00:05:18.100
In Norse mythology, he is the strongest war god,

00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:22.366
and he is also called the Thunder Berserker.

00:05:22.366 --> 00:05:29.266
He uses Mjölnir, a huge Divine Treasure that is bigger than him.

00:05:29.266 --> 00:05:31.366
Humans can't win.

00:05:31.366 --> 00:05:32.766
He is too strong!

00:05:33.266 --> 00:05:38.466
Anyway, how are humans going to fight against the gods?

00:05:38.466 --> 00:05:41.466
Some people might think that way,

00:05:41.466 --> 00:05:44.533
but there is something behind this.

00:05:44.533 --> 00:05:49.933
The Valkyries can unite their souls with souls of the human fighters,

00:05:49.933 --> 00:05:52.366
and they can transform their bodies

00:05:52.366 --> 00:05:57.266
into the most suitable Divine Treasure for the fighter.

00:05:57.266 --> 00:05:59.033
This power is called Völundr.

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:03.333
It makes defeating the gods possible.

00:06:03.333 --> 00:06:04.166
That's right.

00:06:04.166 --> 00:06:07.166
By using Völundr,

00:06:07.166 --> 00:06:10.200
humans can somehow fight with gods,

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:14.200
but there is a huge price to pay when they use it.

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:19.300
Please watch the anime to see what price they have to pay for it.

00:06:19.300 --> 00:06:25.700
That's all for my brief introduction to the world of RECORD OF RAGNAROK.

00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:29.433
If the above information makes you interested in the anime,

00:06:29.433 --> 00:06:32.466
please do watch it on Netflix!

00:06:33.066 --> 00:06:35.500
N-ko's One-on-one Match!

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:40.500
Now, I'm going to have one-on-one matches with the production company,

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:42.666
the characters,

00:06:42.666 --> 00:06:45.666
and the all-star cast of voice actors.

00:06:45.666 --> 00:06:48.133
That is what I'll do in this section.

00:06:48.133 --> 00:06:52.133
Who wins will depend on what I feel.

00:06:52.133 --> 00:06:54.300
If I think I win, I win.

00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:56.900
If I think I lose, I lose.

00:06:56.900 --> 00:06:59.566
Well then, let's begin now!

00:06:59.566 --> 00:07:01.600
It's party time.

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:03.633
The first round,

00:07:03.633 --> 00:07:06.600
a one-on-one match with the production company.

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:09.433
Where is the production company?

00:07:09.433 --> 00:07:11.966
JUNI TAISEN: ZODIAC WAR, PROMARE…

00:07:11.966 --> 00:07:14.966
They are all strong anime.

00:07:14.966 --> 00:07:19.866
I can't win if the crew is as strong as this.

00:07:19.866 --> 00:07:21.866
So for now, the first round…

00:07:21.866 --> 00:07:23.700
I'll let them win…

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:25.366
Next, the second round.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:30.600
The character designer, what other anime did he work on?

00:07:31.100 --> 00:07:32.100
A legend!

00:07:32.633 --> 00:07:36.766
What should I do? Maybe I can't win even once.

00:07:36.766 --> 00:07:39.366
I'll pull myself together and enter the third round.

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:43.533
A one-on-one match with the all-star lineup of voice actors.

00:07:43.533 --> 00:07:45.333
They're all too strong.

00:07:45.333 --> 00:07:48.066
My ears and my eyes are crushed.

00:07:50.033 --> 00:07:52.966
I'm already worn out, but next,

00:07:52.966 --> 00:07:55.900
it's a one-on-one match with the opening song.

00:07:55.900 --> 00:07:58.500
I admit defeat.

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:03.733
RECORD OF RAGNAROK has completely defeated me.

00:08:03.733 --> 00:08:05.733
It's really strong.

00:08:05.733 --> 00:08:10.166
How was my introduction to RECORD OF RAGNAROK?

00:08:10.166 --> 00:08:14.833
If it informed you even just a little of the charm of RECORD OF RAGNAROK,

00:08:14.833 --> 00:08:16.666
I'll be very happy.

00:08:16.666 --> 00:08:20.800
RECORD OF RAGNAROK is streaming on Netflix,

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:22.200
so after you watch the anime,

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:25.166
leave a comment or use hashtags, and let's talk about it.

00:08:25.166 --> 00:08:30.033
I'd like to know your favorite character and favorite one-on-one battle.

00:08:30.033 --> 00:08:33.433
Let's meet again next time!

00:08:33.433 --> 00:08:35.100
See you!

